Date: Wed, 23 Jan 2019 15:18:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] lan743x: Backport SGMII support from 6.9 to 4.19.289 kernel
 version.

This patch contains all the changes backported from v6.9 to v4.19.289
for SGMII support of lan743x driver.
